{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "zgpgy9cg4161wrm6", "title": "41.全参数微调需要多少显存？", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uab9a7150\" id=\"uab9a7150\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uef23ec69\" id=\"uef23ec69\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751694669634-f6599dc5-d925-4736-bc66-8e499ede1340.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubf922249-b1a2-4ea9-80b0-daabfc2d0f3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubdfbc00b-c8ea-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A571.7333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A255%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A87011%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1072%2C%22originHeight%22%3A479%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A45%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A822%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%94%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A176%2C%22height%22%3A45%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%E7%9B%B8%E5%8A%A0%22%2C%22x%22%3A822%2C%22y%22%3A420%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A421%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A188%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%99%A8%E6%9E%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A824%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B9%98%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A819%2C%22y%22%3A298%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22x%22%3A421%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%E5%80%BC%E4%BC%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%E7%B3%BB%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A821%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udb1a37b9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9430a7df\" id=\"u9430a7df\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8655f73\" id=\"ud8655f73\">全参数微调（Full Parameter Fine-Tuning）的显存需求是LLM开发的核心问题，需从</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf5d2ef63\" id=\"uf5d2ef63\">模型参数、梯度、优化器状态、激活值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucdb2618b\" id=\"ucdb2618b\">四个维度计算。核心公式：<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud6083f6c\" id=\"ud6083f6c\">显存占用 ≈ 参数量 × (2 + 2 + 12) × 精度系数 + 激活值</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u41a5fd3f\"><li fid=\"u53aff8e0\" data-lake-id=\"u2c396040\" id=\"u2c396040\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u960fe84a\" id=\"u960fe84a\">2</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud8d360bf\" id=\"ud8d360bf\">：参数（FP16）</span></li><li fid=\"u53aff8e0\" data-lake-id=\"uf7893b47\" id=\"uf7893b47\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue9bcedeb\" id=\"ue9bcedeb\">2</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u534b8c18\" id=\"u534b8c18\">：梯度（FP16）</span></li><li fid=\"u53aff8e0\" data-lake-id=\"ufb6fe0f7\" id=\"ufb6fe0f7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u24f9871f\" id=\"u24f9871f\">12</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub2ccfe4c\" id=\"ub2ccfe4c\">：优化器状态（Adam需FP32动量+方差） </span></li><li fid=\"u53aff8e0\" data-lake-id=\"u0ffa08e4\" id=\"u0ffa08e4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u327f1817\" id=\"u327f1817\">激活值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6d4abf7f\" id=\"u6d4abf7f\">：与批次大小、序列长度正相关</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uf996106a\" id=\"uf996106a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u206d80b2\" id=\"u206d80b2\">以下通过真实项目案例拆解计算逻辑，并提供优化方案。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22akEoT%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"742621eb\" id=\"742621eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub92e7123\" id=\"ub92e7123\">二、项目案例：医疗问答系统微调</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ue682c386\" id=\"ue682c386\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751694682084-8d2c443f-156c-4623-9c99-90c89a365658.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5f188051-e813-4b64-966b-5f8196d35e2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubdfbc00b-c8ea-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A584%2C%22height%22%3A383%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A126225%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1095%2C%22originHeight%22%3A718%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E8%87%AA%E6%A0%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A822%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A176%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A428%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A347%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88~%22%2C%22x%22%3A428%2C%22y%22%3A589%2C%22width%22%3A193%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A428%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%A7%84%E6%A8%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A195%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E7%82%B9%E6%8A%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A825%2C%22y%22%3A528%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO%E5%B9%B6%E8%A1%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A824%2C%22y%22%3A652%2C%22width%22%3A187%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%99%A8%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A826%2C%22y%22%3A394%2C%22width%22%3A173%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9F%BA%E5%BA%A7%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A827%2C%22y%22%3A9%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A826%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A591%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A824%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A269%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%E5%B3%B0%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22x%22%3A819%2C%22y%22%3A455%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u17cb485a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"cfa8a830\" id=\"cfa8a830\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17a7c6cf\" id=\"u17a7c6cf\">背景需求</span></h4><ul list=\"u59678609\"><li fid=\"ue5f4ed07\" data-lake-id=\"u540a020a\" id=\"u540a020a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf6372af9\" id=\"uf6372af9\">基座模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u888e9910\" id=\"u888e9910\">：LLaMA-7B（70亿参数）</span></li><li fid=\"ue5f4ed07\" data-lake-id=\"ue4b0632a\" id=\"ue4b0632a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u262baa90\" id=\"u262baa90\">任务</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub5303b05\" id=\"ub5303b05\">：医疗指令微调（SFT） </span></li><li fid=\"ue5f4ed07\" data-lake-id=\"u322c1be6\" id=\"u322c1be6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf029de3d\" id=\"uf029de3d\">硬件</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u44d5f88c\" id=\"u44d5f88c\">：8×NVIDIA A100 80GB</span></li><li fid=\"ue5f4ed07\" data-lake-id=\"u9749f449\" id=\"u9749f449\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u198dc4e9\" id=\"u198dc4e9\">数据</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u955751fd\" id=\"u955751fd\">：50万条医患问答对（max_length=2048）</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"1c8348dc\" id=\"1c8348dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0bba172f\" id=\"u0bba172f\">显存需求分项计算</span></h4><ol list=\"u56aabc39\"><li fid=\"u9a2d9946\" data-lake-id=\"u401555e0\" id=\"u401555e0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u21b6d0c2\" id=\"u21b6d0c2\">模型参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udac18a3e\" id=\"udac18a3e\">（FP16）</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u712653b4\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uae9320ad\" data-lake-id=\"u80b0e825\" id=\"u80b0e825\"><span data-lake-id=\"u780c4677\" id=\"u780c4677\">计算：7B × 2字节 = 14 GB</span></li><li fid=\"uae9320ad\" data-lake-id=\"u16e86e34\" id=\"u16e86e34\"><span data-lake-id=\"u12e3903a\" id=\"u12e3903a\">实际：LLaMA-7B实际参数量为6.7B，占用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5fd84dba\" id=\"u5fd84dba\">13.4 GB</span></strong></li></ul><ol list=\"u56aabc39\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u9a2d9946\" data-lake-id=\"u7af2c47b\" id=\"u7af2c47b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uac093777\" id=\"uac093777\">梯度</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u28c9f615\" id=\"u28c9f615\">（FP16）</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u456088f5\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc6c46ea5\" data-lake-id=\"u451646cd\" id=\"u451646cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u809e0831\" id=\"u809e0831\">梯度与参数量同大小：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u074564c3\" id=\"u074564c3\">13.4 GB</span></strong></li></ul><ol list=\"u56aabc39\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u9a2d9946\" data-lake-id=\"ue69cbd00\" id=\"ue69cbd00\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u237457e5\" id=\"u237457e5\">优化器状态</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u46bde7e7\" id=\"u46bde7e7\">（Adam） </span></li></ol><ul list=\"u72d18ea4\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u186bdfcb\" data-lake-id=\"u855961ea\" id=\"u855961ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"u903c6206\" id=\"u903c6206\">动量（FP32）：6.7B × 4字节 = 26.8 GB</span></li><li fid=\"u186bdfcb\" data-lake-id=\"u9570df68\" id=\"u9570df68\"><span data-lake-id=\"u448f281c\" id=\"u448f281c\">方差（FP32）：26.8 GB</span></li><li fid=\"u186bdfcb\" data-lake-id=\"u9de3cc8a\" id=\"u9de3cc8a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u650fa70a\" id=\"u650fa70a\">总计：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30196e5b\" id=\"u30196e5b\">53.6 GB</span></strong></li></ul><ol list=\"u56aabc39\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u9a2d9946\" data-lake-id=\"u4c758075\" id=\"u4c758075\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueef63ac8\" id=\"ueef63ac8\">激活值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucb5f4486\" id=\"ucb5f4486\">（最大峰值）</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ua76dd74c\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6312823e\" data-lake-id=\"u7bad1437\" id=\"u7bad1437\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47ba9606\" id=\"u47ba9606\">公式：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u00733733\" id=\"u00733733\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2882b4b6\" id=\"u2882b4b6\">batch_size × seq_len × hidden_size × layers × 12</span></code></li><li fid=\"u6312823e\" data-lake-id=\"udececc81\" id=\"udececc81\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07b6e771\" id=\"u07b6e771\">以batch_size=32、seq_len=2048、hidden_size=4096、32层计算：<br /></span><code data-lake-id=\"u12cbca45\" id=\"u12cbca45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u24ed6b88\" id=\"u24ed6b88\">32 × 2048 × 4096 × 32 × 12 ≈ 98 GB</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3a3d3507\" id=\"u3a3d3507\">（理论值）</span></li><li fid=\"u6312823e\" data-lake-id=\"u26fd2eb7\" id=\"u26fd2eb7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b7cb405\" id=\"u6b7cb405\">实际优化后：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uab02939b\" id=\"uab02939b\">35 GB</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u043114f1\" id=\"u043114f1\">（梯度检查点技术）</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u56aabc39\" start=\"5\"><li fid=\"u9a2d9946\" data-lake-id=\"u7ee552dd\" id=\"u7ee552dd\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e92f872\" id=\"u7e92f872\">总显存峰值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uff3f4b2f\" id=\"uff3f4b2f\"><br /></span><code data-lake-id=\"u8672a41f\" id=\"u8672a41f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3d61b02\" id=\"ub3d61b02\">13.4（参数） + 13.4（梯度） + 53.6（优化器） + 35（激活值） = 115.4 GB</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u20268896\" id=\"u20268896\"><br />→ </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufdf40d59\" id=\"ufdf40d59\">单卡需≥120GB显存</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe83a779\" id=\"ufe83a779\"> → 需8卡并行（ZeRO-3优化后显存降至45GB/卡）。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22khIc6%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"c1822661\" id=\"c1822661\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9b231f4\" id=\"ub9b231f4\">三、示例回答</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub998e646\" id=\"ub998e646\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751694694385-513b8595-11bd-4158-92cb-b670cd93d94f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf5367250-64d9-4eb8-a6f2-f7e4dd94ce0%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubdfbc00b-c8ea-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A723.2%2C%22height%22%3A391%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A156678%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1356%2C%22originHeight%22%3A734%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E7%82%B9%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A1037%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A210%2C%22height%22%3A53%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%B0%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A1034%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A207%2C%22height%22%3A51%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1034%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A207%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A533%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A221%2C%22height%22%3A58%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A533%2C%22y%22%3A577%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A57%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%E9%A2%84%E4%BC%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A1034%2C%22y%22%3A162%2C%22width%22%3A218%2C%22height%22%3A53%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%99%A8%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A1039%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A207%2C%22height%22%3A53%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%E5%9B%9E%E7%AD%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A240%2C%22height%22%3A58%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2213B%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9C%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A1038%2C%22y%22%3A581%2C%22width%22%3A244%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1034%2C%22y%22%3A657%2C%22width%22%3A212%2C%22height%22%3A55%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1036%2C%22y%22%3A414%2C%22width%22%3A227%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A533%2C%22y%22%3A86%2C%22width%22%3A233%2C%22height%22%3A56%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227B%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%85%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A1033%2C%22y%22%3A503%2C%22width%22%3A222%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u56fc5d9f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud6d5198d\" id=\"ud6d5198d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7c61f3b\" id=\"ub7c61f3b\">面试官您好！关于全参数微调的显存需求，我结合参与的医疗问答系统项目说明：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufd1f24ef\" id=\"ufd1f24ef\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8646ca5b\" id=\"u8646ca5b\">1. 核心公式</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u024d1d3d\" id=\"u024d1d3d\"><br />显存 ≈ 参数量 × 16 × 精度系数 + 激活值。以LLaMA-7B为例：</span></p><ul list=\"u156abc02\"><li fid=\"uc4bb0887\" data-lake-id=\"u8149fca7\" id=\"u8149fca7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9194ce95\" id=\"u9194ce95\">参数+梯度：6.7B × 2 × 2 = 26.8 GB（FP16）</span></li><li fid=\"uc4bb0887\" data-lake-id=\"u522b6ba9\" id=\"u522b6ba9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u494f2661\" id=\"u494f2661\">Adam优化器：6.7B × 12 = 80.4 GB（FP32动量+方差）</span></li><li fid=\"uc4bb0887\" data-lake-id=\"uca7cefd6\" id=\"uca7cefd6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub688b55e\" id=\"ub688b55e\">激活值：35 GB（batch_size=32, seq_len=2048）<br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud8b460cd\" id=\"ud8b460cd\">峰值显存 ≈ 142 GB</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u343e7e78\" id=\"u343e7e78\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf463fec0\" id=\"uf463fec0\">2. 实战优化方案</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u158617c2\"><li fid=\"ud3d3940b\" data-lake-id=\"ua44faa35\" id=\"ua44faa35\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u356f9bcf\" id=\"u356f9bcf\">梯度检查点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf5e2e799\" id=\"uf5e2e799\">：激活值显存从98GB→35GB（牺牲30%速度）</span></li><li fid=\"ud3d3940b\" data-lake-id=\"u75d281ed\" id=\"u75d281ed\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d4564f8\" id=\"u5d4564f8\">混合精度训练</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u68125cb1\" id=\"u68125cb1\">：优化器状态用FP16，显存减半（收敛速度降15%） </span></li><li fid=\"ud3d3940b\" data-lake-id=\"ua86cbbdb\" id=\"ua86cbbdb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u47753917\" id=\"u47753917\">ZeRO-3</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u874a7d1e\" id=\"u874a7d1e\">：8卡数据并行，单卡显存降至45GB</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u24576c8b\" id=\"u24576c8b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u40315c6e\" id=\"u40315c6e\">3. 硬件选型建议</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u2d338a5a\"><li fid=\"u768e97d9\" data-lake-id=\"ufc50f4eb\" id=\"ufc50f4eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u840d836b\" id=\"u840d836b\">7B模型：至少8×A100 80GB（ZeRO-3）</span></li><li fid=\"u768e97d9\" data-lake-id=\"uda7ff70c\" id=\"uda7ff70c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba1ce86d\" id=\"uba1ce86d\">13B模型：需16×A100 80GB</span></li><li fid=\"u768e97d9\" data-lake-id=\"u29a6642a\" id=\"u29a6642a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u456b7b57\" id=\"u456b7b57\">关键点：避免激活值成为瓶颈（增大</span><code data-lake-id=\"u59608a15\" id=\"u59608a15\"><span data-lake-id=\"udcc4326f\" id=\"udcc4326f\">batch_size</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ude6af4c4\" id=\"ude6af4c4\">需同步增加显存）</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kNAJ2%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"2d325051\" id=\"2d325051\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c7cf3ec\" id=\"u5c7cf3ec\">四、总结</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua80d2918\" id=\"ua80d2918\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751694713068-1a5ddee9-9ca0-4238-8608-e523228e0a74.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2df647be-c8a9-4cc0-885c-1fe65fdfd4f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubdfbc00b-c8ea-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A704.5333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A353%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A144111%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1321%2C%22originHeight%22%3A661%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E7%BB%93%E8%AE%BA%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A206%2C%22height%22%3A59%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1012%2C%22y%22%3A503%2C%22width%22%3A209%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E7%82%B9%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1010%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A226%2C%22height%22%3A54%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%B2%BE%E5%BA%A6%E6%9D%83%E8%A1%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1013%2C%22y%22%3A256%2C%22width%22%3A209%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%88%99%22%2C%22x%22%3A514%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A202%2C%22height%22%3A55%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A1012%2C%22y%22%3A576%2C%22width%22%3A215%2C%22height%22%3A60%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%22%2C%22x%22%3A516%2C%22y%22%3A503%2C%22width%22%3A216%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%E5%80%8D%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A1014%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A54%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A513%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A226%2C%22height%22%3A58%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LORA%E5%AF%B9E%E6%AF%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A1013%2C%22y%22%3A428%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO%E5%88%86%E9%9A%BE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1014%2C%22y%22%3A336%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%A0%E7%94%A8%E6%BA%90%E6%9E%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A1013%2C%22y%22%3A86%2C%22width%22%3A210%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uec9552a4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"772abdc8\" id=\"772abdc8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua5bcbb07\" id=\"ua5bcbb07\">关键结论</span></h4><ol list=\"u2ede07aa\"><li fid=\"u7814613a\" data-lake-id=\"u630c5458\" id=\"u630c5458\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u67290718\" id=\"u67290718\">显存经验法则</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud183db39\" id=\"ud183db39\">：全参数微调需 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua413e186\" id=\"ua413e186\">20×参数量</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub1fdad6a\" id=\"ub1fdad6a\">（如7B模型需140GB）。 </span></li><li fid=\"u7814613a\" data-lake-id=\"u1533b3ab\" id=\"u1533b3ab\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8eb7d1c5\" id=\"u8eb7d1c5\">四大占用源</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua1485a64\" id=\"ua1485a64\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"u5b51afdd\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u2ec739e4\" data-lake-id=\"u7b9b28a4\" id=\"u7b9b28a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5ca33353\" id=\"u5ca33353\">参数/梯度：参数量×4字节（FP16）</span></li><li fid=\"u2ec739e4\" data-lake-id=\"ub48f7615\" id=\"ub48f7615\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19d7da45\" id=\"u19d7da45\">优化器：参数量×12字节（Adam）</span></li><li fid=\"u2ec739e4\" data-lake-id=\"u08448b98\" id=\"u08448b98\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45f8542b\" id=\"u45f8542b\">激活值：与</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua4d95227\" id=\"ua4d95227\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67b09122\" id=\"u67b09122\">batch_size×seq_len²</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3d6f6334\" id=\"u3d6f6334\">正相关</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u2ede07aa\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u7814613a\" data-lake-id=\"u8dab0a1a\" id=\"u8dab0a1a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud1c52fbe\" id=\"ud1c52fbe\">优化核心</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4823b197\" id=\"u4823b197\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"u825f4d4b\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u3e24b9dd\" data-lake-id=\"u1fa30be8\" id=\"u1fa30be8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u41164ebe\" id=\"u41164ebe\">梯度检查点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub80bad4a\" id=\"ub80bad4a\">：用时间换空间（激活值↓50%）</span></li><li fid=\"u3e24b9dd\" data-lake-id=\"ucea40a62\" id=\"ucea40a62\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u31081bb0\" id=\"u31081bb0\">混合精度</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua5c8fb9d\" id=\"ua5c8fb9d\">：优化器FP16→显存减半（精度损失可控）</span></li><li fid=\"u3e24b9dd\" data-lake-id=\"u2e0f3dcf\" id=\"u2e0f3dcf\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0815cbfd\" id=\"u0815cbfd\">ZeRO-3</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6e7ce1b8\" id=\"u6e7ce1b8\">：多卡分摊优化器状态（显存线性递减）</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"e6b02f36\" id=\"e6b02f36\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc2ab55bb\" id=\"uc2ab55bb\">面试延伸建议</span></h4><ul list=\"u1e7e14dd\"><li fid=\"ubf4ddb01\" data-lake-id=\"ude566491\" id=\"ude566491\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6444e4b\" id=\"ub6444e4b\">若被问及LoRA等轻量微调，可对比： </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u6ab411b8\" id=\"u6ab411b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ad45b96\" id=\"u1ad45b96\">“全参数微调需120GB显存时，LoRA仅需14GB（秩=8），但任务效果下降约5%”</span></p><ul list=\"u1e7e14dd\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ubf4ddb01\" data-lake-id=\"ue7698963\" id=\"ue7698963\"><span data-lake-id=\"udad871d6\" id=\"udad871d6\">强调工程权衡： </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u9253f288\" id=\"u9253f288\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee9e7ad1\" id=\"uee9e7ad1\">“在医疗等专业领域，我们优先选全参数微调以保证知识完整性，通过ZeRO-3解决显存瓶颈。”</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua45e58fe\" id=\"ua45e58fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95408ab2\" id=\"u95408ab2\">💡</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7e02c8bc\" id=\"u7e02c8bc\"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubca8f853\" id=\"ubca8f853\">终极公式</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub6c91980\" id=\"ub6c91980\">：全参数微调显存 = 参数量 × (2 + 2 + 12) × 1.2（冗余系数） + batch_size × seq_len × 0.4 MB</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 966, "description": "一、答题思路全参数微调（Full Parameter Fine-Tuning）的显存需求是LLM开发的核心问题，需从模型参数、梯度、优化器状态、激活值四个维度计算。核心公式：显存占用 ≈ 参数量 × (2 + 2 + 12) × 精度系数 + 激活值2：参数（FP16）2：梯度（FP16）12...", "updated_at": "2025-07-13T05:54:09.000Z", "created_at": "2025-07-09T02:20:30.000Z", "id": 227234847, "status": 1}